6c2|n|A pleasure boat; a vessel or boat of state, elegantly furnished and decorated. ; A large, roomy boat for the conveyance of passengers or goods; as, a ship's barge; a charcoal barge. ; A large boat used by flag officers. ; A double-decked passenger or freight vessel, towed by a steamboat. ; A large omnibus used for excursions.	N:1jxo,111,4~1jxo,111,4
