6fs|n|A rock of igneous origin, consisting of augite and triclinic feldspar, with grains of magnetic or titanic iron, and also bottle-green particles of olivine frequently disseminated. ; An imitation, in pottery, of natural basalt; a kind of black porcelain.	v:sao,136,4~sao,136,4
